WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Coding agents write code. Who checks the plan, the cost and the tests?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Agent Dev Crew runs a team of agents and keeps a trace of every step.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
You approve the plan, or ask for changes, before any code.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Every step shows its prompt, tools, tokens, cost and time.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Hidden tests, never shown to the agents, decide if it passed.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A run can propose a rule. It joins the playbook only if you approve.

7
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Hard set: one agent 100%, crew 88%. The crew costs 1.9× as much.
